From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Myles Liu <lyx981mike@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:03:26 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] qualcommax: ipq50xx: add Xiaomi Redmi AX3000 (RA81) with
 NSS

Board support modelled on the Xiaomi CR8806 (same IPQ5000 + QCN6102 + QCA8337,
256 MiB) with the RA81 specifics from lutvzn/RA81OpenWRT (v25.12.5 port):

- DTS: QCA8337 CPU port 6 over SGMII (MX2000 layout, vendor MAC6_SGMII),
  TZ 4 MiB, TSENS off, NSS heap 8 MiB, coherent_pool=512K, CR8806 Wi-Fi
  memory layout with the Xiaomi-Redmi-AX3000 calibration variant
- RA81 board data (IPQ5000 board 0x24, QCN6102 0x60) in ipq-wifi files/
- Xiaomi dual-boot A/B upgrade with rollback (preinit arm, init confirm)
- RA81 in the ath11k 256M default and the CR8806 ECM fraglist-GRO default
- drop the NSS bring-up debug options (serial SysRq, unrestricted /dev/mem)
---
